            "heading": "Product Details",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading_size": 16,
            "content": "<p><strong>25L Storage Capacity</strong><br/>The spacious main compartment holds diapers, wipes, spare clothes, bottles, toys, and personal essentials for daily outings and family travel.</p><p><strong>Built-In Fold-Out Changing Station</strong><br/>The expandable section unfolds into a dedicated diaper-changing area, then folds back into the backpack for convenient carrying.</p><p><strong>Organized Pockets</strong><br/>Interior compartments, side pockets, and a rear zippered pocket help separate baby supplies from your personal belongings and keep frequently used items accessible.</p><p><strong>Wide-Opening Main Compartment</strong><br/>The large zippered opening makes it easier to see, pack, and retrieve items without searching through the entire bag.</p><p><strong>Water-Resistant Exterior</strong><br/>The exterior fabric helps resist light splashes and everyday spills. The bag is not designed for submersion.</p><p><strong>Versatile Carrying Options</strong><br/>Adjustable shoulder straps allow backpack carrying, while the top handles provide a convenient alternative for short trips.</p><p><strong>Changing Pad Size</strong><br/>The changing pad measures approximately 27 × 13 inches (68 × 33 cm).</p>",
            "content_size": 14,
            "page": "",
