            "title": "True Hands-Free Comfort vs. Exhausting Arm Strain",
            "text": "<p>Eliminates the physical fatigue of holding or cradling your baby for hours during long layovers or flights. Gives your arms and back a complete rest while keeping baby safely nestled right next to you.</p>"
