            "body": "<p>The bassinet function is a lifesaver when shopping at the mall! I used to stress about leaving my baby on hard public benches with just a thin towel, worrying he might roll over. This gives me peace of mind. It's a bit bulky when fully packed, but the safety and convenience are well worth it!</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Gemini_Generated_Image_c0n7fxc0n7fxc0n7_1.png"
          }
        },
        "review_a5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Michael B.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>Solid structure and great craftsmanship! I was worried the bassinet part might feel flimsy, but the support rods hold it firm and stable. The padded shoulder straps also make carrying a heavy 25L load surprisingly comfortable.</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_wch9ap": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Rachel Adams",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>Very sturdy and premium feel. The zippers slide smoothly without snagging, and the water-resistant coating really works. It feels much more expensive than it actually is!</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/71LEUp4nfbL.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_cUryjU": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Olivia P.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>Game changer for grocery shopping! Instead of balancing my baby on hard, germy supermarket benches with just a thin towel—constantly worrying they’ll roll over and fall—I just unfold this bassinet on a quiet bench. Safe, enclosed, and completely stress-free!</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_ra6AQV": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Brian K.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>We use this everywhere, not just at airports! When we go to the mall or park, I don't have to worry about cold wooden benches or safety risks. The raised mesh walls keep my baby secure and contained while I take a break.</p>"
          }
