          "settings": {
            "question": "&nbsp;3. Is the backpack waterproof and easy to clean?&nbsp;",
            "content": "<p>The exterior is water-resistant and helps protect against light splashes and everyday spills. It is not fully waterproof. Spot-clean with a damp cloth and follow the care label for cleaning the bag and changing pad. Allow all sections to dry completely before storing.</p>",
            "default_open": false,
