          "settings": {
            "question": "&nbsp;4. Is it suitable for daily outings and travel?&nbsp;",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The spacious storage, organized pockets, and fold-out changing station make it practical for shopping trips, family visits, and travel. Adjustable shoulder straps offer hands-free carrying, while the top handles provide another convenient carrying option.</p>",
